('2209', 'A8302', 'Bosque dos Ipês-Apto venda, 50 m2, 2 quartos, 1 banhr (box, arm), 1 vg grg, sacd, coznh+gelad, fog', 'xa8302', '1', '1', '', '<p>O apartamento no Bosque dos Ipês tem 50 m2 e possui:<br />- 2 dormitórios (sendo 1 deles com 1 guarda roupas)<br />- 1 banheiro (armário banheiro, box)<br />- 1 vaga de garagem<br />- sacada comum<br />- cozinha planejada (geladeira, fogão, armários)<br />- exaustor<br />- área de serviço (com máquina de lavar roupa)<br />- sala de estar (com cortina)</p>\r\n<p>Condomínio: R$250,00</p>\r\n<p>IPTU 2025: R$600,00</p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery1\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8302 1.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8302 1.jpeg\"},\"gallery2\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8302 2.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8302 2.jpeg\"},\"gallery3\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8302 3.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8302 3.jpeg\"},\"gallery4\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8302 4.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8302 4.jpeg\"},\"gallery5\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8302 5.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8302 5.jpeg\"},\"gallery6\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8302 18.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8302 18.jpeg\"},\"gallery10\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8302 9.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8302 9.jpeg\"},\"gallery8\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8302 7.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8302 7.jpeg\"},\"gallery9\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8302 8.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8302 8.jpeg\"},\"gallery7\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8302 6.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8302 6.jpeg\"},\"gallery11\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8302 10.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8302 10.jpeg\"},\"gallery13\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8302 12.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8302 12.jpeg\"},\"gallery12\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8302 11.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8302 11.jpeg\"},\"gallery15\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8302 14.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8302 14.jpeg\"},\"gallery17\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A8302 16.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"A8302 16.jpeg\"},\"gallery16\":{\"photo\":\"ima