('2292', 'C3791', 'Jd Minas Gerais- Casa venda, 111 m2, 3 quartos, 1 banh+box, 2 vgs garagem coberta, sala, cozinha', 'xc3791', '7', '1', '', '<p>A casa no bairro Jardim Minas Gerais possui:<br />Área construída: 111,50 m²<br />Terreno: 126,00 m²<br />Destaques do imóvel:<br />vista maravilhosa para APP <br />3 dormitórios espaçosos<br />Sala ampla (jantar, estar e TV)<br />Cozinha moderna com porcelanato e revestimentos<br />Banheiro todo revestido<br />Lavanderia independente<br />Quintal espaçoso - perfeito para momentos de lazer<br />Garagem coberta para 2 carros</p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery1\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3791 1.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3791 1.jpg\"},\"gallery3\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3791 13.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3791 13.jpeg\"},\"gallery2\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3791 16.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3791 16.jpeg\"},\"gallery4\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3791 14.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3791 14.jpeg\"},\"gallery5\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3791 15.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3791 15.jpeg\"},\"gallery6\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3791 12.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3791 12.jpeg\"},\"gallery8\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3791 7.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3791 7.jpeg\"},\"gallery9\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3791 8.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3791 8.jpeg\"},\"gallery7\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3791 6.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3791 6.jpeg\"},\"gallery12\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3791 11.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3791 11.jpeg\"},\"gallery11\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3791 10.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3791 10.jpeg\"},\"gallery10\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3791 9.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3791 9.jpeg\"},\"gallery16\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3791 1A.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3791 1A.jpeg\"},\"gallery15\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3791 5.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3791 5.jpeg\"},\"gallery14\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3791 18.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3791 18.jpeg\"},\"gallery13\":{