('2315', 'C3796', 'Residencial São Francisco- Casa 69 m2, condomínio, 2 quartos, 2 banhr, quintal, sacada, 2 vg garagem', 'c3796', '7', '1', '', '<p>A casa no bairro Residencial São Francisco possui 69 m2:<br />- Parte superior: 2 quartos;  Sacada; Banheiro<br />- Térreo: Sala, cozinha, lavabo, área de serviço, quintal<br />Condomínio pequeno ideal para família <br />Ambiente super tranquilo.<br />Portão automático do condomínio <br />Câmeras <br />Garagem: cabem 2 carros convencionais <br />Se for carro grande, cabe 1 carro.</p>\r\n<p>IPTU: R$650,00</p>\r\n<p>Condomínio: R$269,00</p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery1\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3796 1.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3796 1.jpeg\"},\"gallery2\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3796 2.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3796 2.jpeg\"},\"gallery3\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3796 3.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3796 3.jpeg\"},\"gallery6\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3796 5.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3796 5.jpeg\"},\"gallery5\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3796 4.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3796 4.jpeg\"},\"gallery4\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3796 13.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3796 13.jpeg\"},\"gallery7\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3796 6.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3796 6.jpeg\"},\"gallery9\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3796 8.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3796 8.jpeg\"},\"gallery12\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3796 11.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3796 11.jpeg\"},\"gallery10\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3796 9.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3796 9.jpeg\"},\"gallery13\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3796 12.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3796 12.jpeg\"},\"gallery11\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3796 10.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3796 10.jpeg\"},\"gallery8\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3796 7.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3796 7.jpeg\"},\"gallery15\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3796 16.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3796 16.jpeg\"},\"gallery14\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3796 15.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3796 15.jpeg\"},\"gallery16\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3796 17.jpeg\",\"alt_t