('2316', 'C3798', 'Urbanova VII- Casa 163 m2, 3 quartos (3 suítes), quintal, 4 banhr, 2 vgs garg cob+2 descb, área goum', 'xc3798', '7', '1', '', '<p>A casa no bairro Urbanova VII possui 163 metros quadrados com:<br />- 270 m2 de área de terreno<br />- 163 m2 de área construída<br />- 3 quartos sendo 3 suítes (sendo um com closet)<br />- 4 banheiros<br />- 2 vagas de garagem coberta e 2 vagas descobertas<br />- Sala 2 ambientes em conceito aberto e integrada com a área gourmet<br />- Churrasqueira, quintal, duchas e 2 entradas laterais<br />- Preparação para instalação de ar condicionado e aquecimento solar<br />- Jardim<br />Condomínio possui:<br />- Playground<br />- Quadra poliesportiva<br />- Pomar<br />- Portaria 24h</p>\r\n<p>IPTU: R$553,00</p>\r\n<p>Condomínio: R$2230,00</p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery1\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3798 1.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3798 1.jpg\"},\"gallery3\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3798 2.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3798 2.jpg\"},\"gallery2\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3798 4.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3798 4.jpg\"},\"gallery4\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3798 3.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3798 3.jpg\"},\"gallery8\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3798 5.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3798 5.jpg\"},\"gallery7\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3798 27.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3798 27.jpg\"},\"gallery5\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3798 25.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3798 25.jpg\"},\"gallery6\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3798 26.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3798 26.jpg\"},\"gallery9\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3798 6.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3798 6.jpg\"},\"gallery11\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3798 8.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3798 8.jpg\"},\"gallery10\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3798 7.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3798 7.jpg\"},\"gallery12\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3798 9.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3798 9.jpg\"},\"gallery13\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3798 10.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3798 10.jpg\"},\"gallery21\":{\"photo\":\"images/gallery/C3798 18.jpg\",\"alt_text\":